    "description": "Add Prediction Markets to the Vertical picklist / WT_Vertical global value set.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* WT_Vertical global value set — ADD: Prediction Markets. Current values: Sportsbook; Casino; DFS; Sweepstakes.\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Lina asked for it: 'We want to add prediction markets. Joyce, could you add that to our doc? And can we also add that as an option for vertical?' Joyce confirmed; Kobi said 'That's a quick thing, right?'\n\n* Add to the global value set so Deal, Operator and any other consumer picks it up.\n\n* Check the Deal Name generation flow handles the new value — Vertical is a component of the Deal Name (BUILD-49 / BUILD-125).\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* Kobi told Marc on Aug 17 he was taking this one himself. Assigned accordingly.\n\n* Watch the label: Lina said 'prediction markets' plural; earlier notes say singular. Pick one.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Aug 11 call — Lina 1:01:30-1:02:19\n\n* Aug 17 Marc call — Kobi owns it\n\nDependencies: None\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nPolished 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
